      "Build batched and buffered producers with size handling and flush behavior.",
      "Create production consumers with blob checkpoints, event handlers, error handlers, and graceful shutdown.",
      "Apply partition keys, event positions, dependency injection, retry handling, and checkpoint strategies."
    ],
